<title>UK: Unibanco sets $150 mln three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Unibanco sets $150 mln three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Unibanco and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UNIBANCO - UNIAO DE BANCOS BRASILEIROS SA</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     8.0 PCT   MATURITY    30.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.02    PAY DATE    30.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.45	REOFFER    100.02    SPREAD	+150 BP</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR/CY</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
